  "solution": {
    "text": "Given equation, is $x+y+z=10$\r\nwhere, $x, y$ and $z$ are positive integers.\r\n$\\therefore$ Required number of solutions $={ }^{(10-1)} \\mathrm{C}_{(3-1)}$\r\n$$\r\n={ }^{9} C_{2}=\\frac{9 \\times 8}{2}=36\r\n$$",
